    </div>
    <div class="example-panel" id="example-summary" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="example-tab-summary" tabindex="0"><span class="eyebrow">What did I build?</span><h3>A web API, with source to explore.</h3><p><?= e($sample['summary']) ?></p><small>This summary describes source structure. The business purpose and runtime behavior still need human verification.</small></div>
